code: 0
--- stdout
The pull request is open and ready for review

  From:      In progress, Changes requested
  To:        In review; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Refused:   while the issue has the label blocked (exit code 2): ask the user
             resume removes it
  Requires:  --comment; --assignee
  Batch:     gh dojo review 12 13 14: each issue on its own, a failed one skipped;
             exit code 5 when some were written: a re-run finishes the rest
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Labels:    +needs-review -changes-requested (+ adds, - removes)
  Assign:    the --assignee user (a login, or @me for you); other assignees stay
             one who cannot be assigned issues in the repository is exit code 1, with who can
  Blockers:  refused (exit code 2) while a blocker is unresolved (open and not in Merged): ask the user
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               Ready for review by @{assignee}: {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo review <N>... [flags]

Flags:
      --assignee string   the user to assign: a login, or @me for yourself
      --comment string    text for {comment} in the comment
      --comments N|all    how many of the latest comments the card prints, or all (up to 100); implies --show (default 5)
      --dry-run           print the plan without changing anything
      --full              print the card's description and comments without cutting them; implies --show
  -h, --help              help for review
      --show              also print the issue's card, as gh dojo show N does, from the same read

Global flags: --jq, --json, --template (see gh dojo --help)
--- stderr
